# --- .claude/: AI-agent config. Ignore everything, then re-include only the
#     shareable subagent definitions so contributors and their agents can
#     reuse them. Rules, machine state (settings.local.json), shared config
#     (settings.json), slash-commands and hooks stay local. ---
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
# Root CLAUDE.md is now committed; per-library quickstarts remain tracked.
